comments.body:
I think it compiles, because the decl exists twice?

```
git grep GetWalletPath f922025 -- '*.h'
f922025:src/wallet/wallet.h:util::Result<fs::path> GetWalletPath(const std::string& name);
f922025:src/wallet/walletutil.h:util::Result<fs::path> GetWalletPath(const std::string& name);
```

for me it compiles:

```
./build/bin/bitcoin-wallet -version |grep adfcde180e5b
Bitcoin Core bitcoin-wallet utility version v32.99.0-adfcde180e5b

